{"lyrics":"[00:24.12](The Beat Asylum)\n[00:25.32]Wait, ayy\n[00:27.50]Pray to God I live another day, uh, ayy (Oh-oh-oh)\n[00:30.90]Chopper on me, put it to your face, uh, ayy (Oh-oh-oh)\n[00:34.02]I'm so high that I can't feel my face, uh, ayy (Woah-woah-woah)\n[00:37.82]Chopper like a pencil, get erased, uh, ayy (Pew-pew, go-go-go)\n[00:41.28]Shoot a motherfucker in the face, uh ,ayy (In the face)\n[00:44.70]She gon' give me top inside the Wraith, uh-uh (In the Wraith)\n[00:48.24]I keep all my rackades in the safe (Cha-ching, cha-ching)\n[00:51.62]Combination, put it in the safe (Brrt-pew, brrt-pew)\n[00:55.08]Combination, put it in the safe (Brrt-bih, brrt-bih)\n[00:58.38]I can't sleep until them pussies in the grave (Brrt, yeah, yeah)\n[01:01.06]What a day, what a day (What a day, what a day, bih)\n[01:05.02]Out of line, we gon' put you in your place (Brrt-bih, brrt-bih, in your place)\n[01:08.82]Claimin' you a shooter, knock it off, you ain't got no bodies (Brrt-bih, brrt-brrt)\n[01:13.12]You a nobody, bloody and I'm cold-hearted (Brrt-bih)\n[01:15.62]Slidin' with my goons, that's my blood (Yeah, what?)\n[01:19.14]Put you on the news, just because (Brrt, gang)\n[01:22.82]Pray to God I live another day, uh, ayy (Oh-oh-oh)\n[01:26.42]Chopper on me, put it to your face, uh, ayy (Oh-oh-oh)\n[01:30.08]I'm so high that I can't feel my face, uh, ayy (Woah-woah-woah)\n[01:32.92]Chopper like a pencil, get erased, uh, ayy (Pew-pew, go-go-go)\n[01:36.38]Shoot a motherfucker in the face, uh ,ayy (In the face)\n[01:39.80]She gon' give me top inside the Wraith, uh-uh (In the Wraith)\n[01:43.40]I keep all my rackades in the safe (Cha-ching, cha-ching)\n[01:46.70]Combination, put it in the safe (Bih-bih)\n[01:50.26]Me and D. Savage boolin' by the lake (Woah-woah-woah)\n[01:53.62]Lookin' for some hoes to dinner date (Woah-woah-woah)\n[01:56.88]If niggas want some beef, we make 'em steak (Bih-bih-bih, ayy)\n[02:00.90]Pull up on 'em, no license plates, leave a nigga too erased (Skr-skr-skr-skrrt)\n[02:03.94]Yeah, I stay up in the studio, ain't takin' no calls (Ain't takin' no calls)\n[02:07.34]My homies just took your bitch, my nigga, that's your fault (Uh-huh, uh)\n[02:10.40]You talkin' shit to us, we leave you face down in the sidewalk (Uh-huh, uh)\n[02:13.82]Don't gotta say much, load it up, and I'm lettin' my gun talk, ayy (Pew-pew-pew)\n[02:17.70]Pray to God I live another day, uh, ayy (Oh-oh-oh)\n[02:21.22]Chopper on me, put it to your face, uh, ayy (Oh-oh-oh)\n[02:24.72]I'm so high that I can't feel my face, uh, ayy (Woah-woah-woah)\n[02:28.00]Chopper like a pencil, get erased, uh, ayy (Pew-pew, go-go-go)\n[02:31.48]Shoot a motherfucker in the face, uh ,ayy (In the face)\n[02:34.90]She gon' give me top inside the Wraith, uh-uh (In the Wraith)\n[02:38.62]I keep all my rackades in the safe (Cha-ching, cha-ching)\n[02:41.80]Combination, put it in the safe (Bih-bih)","words":[[24.12,24.16,"(The"],[24.44,24.58,"Beat"],[24.66,25.12,"Asylum)"],[25.32,25.58,"Wait,"],[27.1,27.2,"ayy"],[27.5,27.64,"Pray"],[27.72,27.78,"to"],[27.92,28.14,"God"],[28.28,28.28,"I"],[28.36,28.64,"live"],[28.86,29.1,"another"],[29.22,29.26,"day,"],[29.32,29.34,"uh,"],[29.38,29.44,"ayy"],[29.6,29.72,"(Oh-oh-oh)"],[30.9,31.24,"Chopper"],[31.44,31.46,"on"],[31.58,31.66,"me,"],[31.78,32.0,"put"],[32.08,32.16,"it"],[32.22,32.32,"to"],[32.42,32.52,"your"],[32.64,32.98,"face,"],[33.02,33.04,"uh,"],[33.08,33.14,"ayy"],[33.18,33.98,"(Oh-oh-oh)"],[34.02,34.52,"I'm"],[34.6,34.68,"so"],[34.76,34.84,"high"],[35.04,35.26,"that"],[35.34,35.34,"I"],[35.44,35.62,"can't"],[35.66,35.82,"feel"],[35.88,36.04,"my"],[36.12,36.42,"face,"],[36.46,36.56,"uh,"],[36.6,36.8,"ayy"],[36.92,37.44,"(Woah-woah-woah)"],[37.82,38.18,"Chopper"],[38.3,38.5,"like"],[38.54,38.54,"a"],[38.7,39.04,"pencil,"],[39.14,39.2,"get"],[39.24,39.34,"erased,"],[39.42,39.56,"uh,"],[39.68,39.76,"ayy"],[39.92,40.16,"(Pew-pew,"],[40.44,41.22,"go-go-go)"],[41.28,41.5,"Shoot"],[41.56,41.56,"a"],[41.7,42.52,"motherfucker"]